"name":"based on true story"},{"id":8624,"name":"climbing"},{"id":8626,"name":"yosemite"},{"id":201008,"name":"rock climbing"},{"id":235710,"name":"el capitan"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"AU","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Melbourne International Film Festival","release_date":"2018-08-06T00:00:00.000Z","type":1}]},{"iso_3166_1":"DE","release_dates":[{"certification":"12","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"2017-11-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"GB","release_dates":[{"certification":"15","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"2018-07-17T00:00:00.000Z","type":2}]},{"iso_3166_1":"NL","release_dates":[{"certification":"9","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"IDFA","release_date":"2017-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","type":1}]},{"iso_3166_1":"US","release_dates":[{"certification":"NR","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"South by Southwest Film Festival","release_date":"2018-03-11T00:00:00.000Z","type":1}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"","overview":"In an unbelievable story of perseverance, free climber Tommy Caldwell and climbing partner Kevin Jorgeson attempt to scale the impossible 3000ft Dawn Wall of El Capitan.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Durch die Wand","overview":"Im Januar 2015 beginnen die amerikanischen Bergsteiger Tommy Caldwell und Kevin Jorgeson ihren Aufstieg an der sogenannten Dawn Wall, einer der Felswände an der berühmten Felsformation El Capitan im kalifornischen Yosemite-Nationalpark. Insgesamt 19 Tage dauert der Aufstieg und während dieser Zeit leben die Männer an der steilen Felswand – sie schlafen in einem Zelt, das am Felsen befestigt wird. Vor allem Caldwell wird dabei von seiner traumatischen Vergangenheit angetrieben: Im Alter von 22 Jahren wurde er in Kirgisistan von Rebellen gefangen genommen, verlor einige Jahre später einen Zeigefinger und musste zudem das Ende seiner Ehe mit seiner langjährigen Kletterpartnerin verkraften.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"it","iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","title":"","overview":"Nel gennaio del 2015 gli scalatori americani Tommy Caldwell e Kevin Jorgeson hanno affascinato il mondo con la loro scalata al Dawn Wall, una parete rocciosa considerata impossibile, alta oltre 3 mila piedi e situata all'interno dello Yosemite National Park, in California. Per Caldwell, la scalata  era una sfida con se stesso: preso in ostaggio a 22 anni dai ribelli in Kirghizistan, poco dopo perse un indice in un incidente ma decise di non arrendersi, impegnandosi per sei anni, in un mix di dedizione e ossessione, a progettare meticolosamente l'impresa.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"","overview":"El legendario escalador Tommy Caldwell, secuestrado hace años en Kirguistán, intenta superar un bajo estado anímico escalando 900 metros de por la cara más escarpada de una legendaria roca: la Dawn Wall de El Capitan.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pl","iso_3166_1":"PL","name":"Polski","english_name":"Polish","title":"Dawn Wall: Wspinaczka po rekord","overview":"W Parku Narodowym Yosemite w Kalifornii znajduje się granitowy monolit El Capitan, marzenie wielu wspinaczy. Amerykańscy wspinacze Tommy Caldwell i Kevin Jorgeson postanowili po raz pierwszy w historii pokonać tę trudną trasę skalną bez lin i pomocniczego sprzętu. Film dokumentuje ich 19-dniowy wyczyn, pokazując przygotowania, poszczególne etapy i prywatne życie wspinaczy. Wspinają się za pomocą uchwytów i przyczółków nie grubszych niż karta kredytowa, a w nocy śpią w przymocowanych do skały hamakach. Film ujawnia trudne doświadczenia życiowe Caldwella, których kulminacją był projekt wspinaczki na The Dawn Hall, i celebruje wytrwałość, koleżeństwo oraz duch wielkich marzeń, który motywuje człowieka do działania.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"","overview":"In het midden van het Yosemite National Park Towers El Capitan, een groot graniet blok waarvan de soepelste kant, de Dawn Muur , wordt aanzien als de meest moeilijke rots klim in de wereld.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"던월","overview":"세계적인 암벽등반의 성지로 불리는 미국 요세미티 계곡의 엘케피탄, 그 중에서도 900미터가 넘는 직벽 던월은 지금껏 그 누구도 시도할 엄두조차 내지 못한 불가능한 벽으로 여겨졌다. 지난 6년을 한결같이 던월에 매진한 토미 칼드웰과 케빈 조거슨. 무려 19일 간 벽에 매달린 채 먹고 자며 계속된 이들의 도전에 미디어가 몰려들고 손에 땀을 쥐게 하는 세기의 등반으로 전 세계가 주목하기 시작한다. 특히 키르기스스탄 원정 등반 중 무장 반군의 포로로 붙잡혔던 트라우마, 이후의 손가락 절단 사고와 이혼까지 많은 고난을 겪은 토미 칼드웰은 던월 등반에 자신의 모든 걸 쏟아 부었다. 하지만 그토록 바랐던 성공과 동료애 사이에서 한치의 망설임도 없는 결정을 내리는 토미 칼드웰, 그렇게 그는 진정한 등반가이자 어른이 된다. (2018년 제3회 울주세계산악영화제 / 최선희)","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"Escalando Dawn Wall","overview":"Em janeiro de 2015, Tommy Caldwell e Kevin Jorgeson escalaram até o topo do El Capitan, no Parque Nacional de Yosemite. The Dawn Wall é um documentário especial sobre os 19 dias de escalada, os anos de esforço e a inspiradora jornada de vida dos alpinistas.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"黎明墙","overview":"讲述两名男子徒手征服“世界最难攀登绝壁”黎明墙的经历，热血沸腾鼓舞人心[并不简单] 2015年1月，Tommy Caldwell和Kevin Jorgeson开始攀登，两人在陡峭的垂直悬崖上生活了数周，引发了全球媒体的狂热关注。对Caldwell来说，这不仅仅是一次攀登，也是证明自己的强大之处的机会：22岁时，Caldwell被吉尔吉斯斯坦叛军挟持为人质，不久后他在一次事故中失去食指。两人耗时将近20天，成功登顶加利福利亚约塞米蒂国家公园的埃尔卡皮坦山，创下了徒手攀上黎明墙的世界纪录。  在此之前，两人花费了6年的时间规划路线，于2010和2011年两次尝试攀爬，均以失败告终。1958年首次有人征服黎明墙，目前约有100多条攀登路线，但从未有人徒手登顶。奥巴马也曾在两人成功后表示祝贺，称“一切皆有可能”。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"el","iso_3166_1":"GR","name":"ελληνικά","english_name":"Greek","title":"Το Τείχος της Αυγής","overview":"Η ταινία περιγράφει την προσπάθεια του αναρριχητή Tommy Caldwell και του σχοινοσύντροφού του Kevin Jorgeson, να σκαρφαλώσουν το dawn wall στο Yosemite National Park.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"tr","iso_3166_1":"TR","name":"Türkçe","english_name":"Turkish","title":"Şafak Duvarı","overview":"Ocak 2015’te Amerikalı kaya tırmanışçıları Tommy Caldwell ve partneri Kevin Jorgeson, Kaliforniya Yosemite Ulusal Parkında 914 metre yükseklikteki Dawn Duvarı’na tırmanma çabalarıyla dünyayı büyülemişti. İkili, bu dikey uçurum üzerinde haftalarca yaşayıp antrenman yaptı. Tommy Caldwell için, Dawn Duvarı bir tırmanıştan çok daha fazlasıydı. Bu tırmanış, engellerin aşılmasıyla tanımlanan bir yaşam süresinin doruğuydu.Adanmışlık ve takıntı arasındaki çizgiyi bulanıklaştıran Caldwell ve ortağı Jorgeson, altı yıllarını titizlikle rota çizerek ve tırmanarak geçirdiler. Bu yolculukları sırasında Caldwell farklı hissetmeye başladı ve artık aklında sadece iki soru vardı; nihai rüyasını yerine getirmek için partnerini terk mi etmeliydi yoksa arkadaşlık uğruna idealini riske mi atmalıydı?","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"TW","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"垂直九十度的熱血人生","overview":"紀錄這則被譽為是「史上最難的攀岩行動」的行動，由美國傳奇攀岩家湯米考德威爾(Tommy Caldwell)與攀岩夥伴凱文約格森（Kevin Jorgeson）歷經19日征戰，以雙手雙腿征服垂直900公尺、讓人望而生畏的「黎明之牆」，登頂「酋長岩」的世界紀錄。導演喬許洛威及彼得莫提默紀錄不僅是他們涉身險境，實現巔峰夢想，更挖掘湯米考德威爾潛藏在熱愛冒險的天性下，靠絕不動搖的決心，面對曾被綁架、痛失食指、離婚等離奇考驗下的人性掙扎，化逆境為人生助力的動人故事。  湯米考德威爾全球公認最優秀的全能攀岩運動員。曾獲選《國家地理》雜誌「年度冒險家」，也是登山界奧斯卡獎「金冰鎬獎」與美國山岳協會最高榮譽得主。《垂直九十度的熱血人生》不僅滿足人類對於征服自然的深沉渴望，更透過熱血冒險家考德威爾努力不懈迎接挑戰，擁抱未知的傳奇故事，成為極富心靈勵志的典範，每次的登峰考驗，都充滿難以忘懷的人生層次，是冒險家們不能錯過的感動之作。「激勵那些需要奮力走過滿地荊棘的人們，並喚醒我們天賦的本能。」","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"he","iso_3166_1":"IL","name":"עִבְרִית","english_name":"Hebrew","title":"שחר חדש ביוסמיטי","overview":"סרט תיעודי ביוגרפי. המצלמות עוקבות אחר טומי קולדוול ו-קווין ג'ורגסון בזמן שהם לוקחים על עצמם אתגר עצום – טיפוס חופשי על קיר הסלע המפחיד ביותר ביוסמיטי.","tagline":"שחר חדש ביוסמיטי"},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"","overview":"Le film incontournable sur l'ascension qui a fait la une des journaux et enflammé l'imagination du monde entier. Tommy Caldwell et Kevin Jorgeson gravissent la paroi la plus difficile de tous les temps : une ascension de 19 jours du Dawn Wall, sur la face verticale d'El Capitan, haute de 900 mètres, dans le parc national de Yosemite. Le film va au-delà de l'ascension, plongeant dans l'histoire des grimpeurs et dressant un portrait intime des expériences de vie difficiles de Caldwell, qui ont abouti à sa détermination à accomplir cette ascension impossible. The Dawn Wall est un film touchant et inspirant qui célèbre la persévérance, la camaraderie et l'esprit universel de rêver grand et de ne jamais abandonner.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ar","iso_3166_1":"SA","name":"العربية","english_name":"Arabic","title":"","overview":"الفيلم الأبرز عن رحلة التسلق التي استحوذت على عناوين الأخبار وألهبت خيال العالم. يتسلق تومي كالدويل وكيفن جورجيسون أصعب جدار ضخم على الإطلاق: تسلق جدار الفجر، على الواجهة العمودية لجبل إل كابيتان الذي يبلغ ارتفاعه 3000 قدم، في منتزه يوسمايت الوطني، لمدة 19 يومًا. يغوص الفيلم في أعماق التسلق، متعمقًا في تاريخ المتسلقين، راسِمًا صورة حميمة لتجارب كالدويل المروعة التي تُوِّجت بإرادة قوية لإتمام هذا التسلق المستحيل. جدار الفجر فيلمٌ مُلهمٌ ومؤثر، يحتفي بالمثابرة والرفقة، والروح العالمية التي تُجسّد الحلم الكبير، وعدم الاستسلام أبدًا.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ro","iso_3166_1":"RO","name":"Română","english_name":"Romanian","title":"","overview":"Documentarul îi prezintă pe Tommy Caldwell și Kevin Jorgeson în încercarea năucitoare de a escalada liber cea mai impresionantă formațiune muntoasă din Yosemite.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"hr","iso_3166_1":"HR","name":"Hrvatski","english_name":"Croatian","title":"Zid svitanja","overview":"Usred nacionalnog parka Yosemite uzdiže se El Capitan, golemi blok granita čija je najglađa strana, Zid svitanja, najteži uspon na svijetu. Tommy Caldwell tu nije vidio negostoljubiv teren, već slagalicu visoku gotovo kilometar. U filmu 'Zid svitanja' pratimo njega i Kevina Jorgesona u njihovom povijesnom usponu na vrh.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"cs","iso_3166_1":"CZ","name":"Český","english_name":"Czech","title":"","overview":"Uprostřed Yosemitského národního parku se tyčí El Capitan, obrovský žulový blok, jehož nejhladší strana, Dawn Wall, je údajně nejtěžším skalním výstupem na světě. Tommy Caldwell neviděl nehostinný terén, ale spíše téměř kilometr vysoký hlavolam. V knize The Dawn Wall sledujeme jeho a Kevina Jorgesona při jejich historickém výstupu na vrchol.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ja","iso_3166_1":"JP","name":"日本語","english_name":"Japanese","title":"ドーンウォール","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"hu","iso_3166_1":"HU","name":"Magyar","english_name":"Hungarian","title":"Hajnalfal","overview":"2015-ben két amerikai sziklamászó, Tommy Caldwell és Kevin Jorgeson az egész világot lenyűgözte azzal, hogy megpróbálták a lehetetlen: megmászni a Dawn Wallt, a Yosemite Nemzeti Park ikonikus sziklája, az El Capitan 910 méteres falát. A páros hetekig a kopár sziklafalon élt, az egész világ rájuk figyelt. Tommy Caldwell-nek a Dawn Wall megmászása sokkal több volt, mint egy kőkemény sportteljesítmény. Tommynak rengeteg nehézséggel kellett szembenéznie élete során. 22 évesen Kirgizisztánban mászott, amikor lázadók ejtették túszul. Nem sokkal később egy balesetben elveszített a mutatóujját, de ezután csak még elszántabban kezdett mászni. Amikor tönkrement a házassága, azzal próbálta feledtetni a fájdalmát, hogy elkezdett a Dawn Wall kötél nélküli megmászásán dolgozni. Az elszántság és a megszállottság határmezsgyéjén mozogva Caldwell és Jorgenson hat évet töltött el azzal, hogy centiméterről centiméterre megtervezte és begyakorolta az utat.","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"5Hc8tB9uhho","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"The Dawn Wall (2018) | Official Trailer HD","iso_639_1":"en","official":true,"published_at":"2018-08-20T17:02:39.000Z","size":1080},{"key":"edfw9ip9sCQ","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"The Dawn Wall - Trailer","iso_639_1":"en","official":true,"published_at":"2018-08-20T13:00:06.000Z","size":1080},{"key":"fRkMaQEVd9c","site":"YouTube","type":"Teaser","name":"The Dawn Wall | Teaser Trailer","iso_639_1":"en","official":true,"published_at":"2018-03-03T08:01:53.000Z","size":1080}],"images":{"posters":[{"file_path":"/bZQCNGb1II5eWASBhEgJBGxOPUM.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":8.77,"vote_count":8},{"file_path":"/qTK0w1NbHERCqJZhjweKEKW4Xwi.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":2},{"file_path":"/vaG8pDRoyDoYEOA0dwWEIQFu38E.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":1.75,"vote_count":4},{"file_path":"/59nv9ljrarAIhUFQruXbGRhoPBn.jpg","width":792,"height":1224,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0.5,"vote_count":4},{"file_path":"/x1T8EqrPxTbXUsnxll5juaiQSHl.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/hJgUvJbj5ohAkF1XfoXfIXiYO0w.jpg","width":736,"height":1104,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}],"backdrops":[{"file_path":"/ipXrm6SEjfNkD8FKfj9VLUE9fUU.jpg","width":2880,"height":1620,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/8Qsw6YbrPEcozaB5odmonNivJk5.jpg","width":3200,"height":1800,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/MtaxtNsMlj77coCB9wzmdAptQz.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":3},{"file_path":"/kKbfDOkssi1NMlWeMWJOZsI5xZu.jpg","width":3840,"height":2160,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/paC2fi2wnOcSHGxSdjZGdxyvQCJ.jpg","width":1280,"height":720,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/kYfDGcBY3UBDBv1nfrA7LyUKpUe.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/ataV4NzLnZVF5oJTQeKUAXhnHwq.jpg","width":1280,"height":720,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/FTIspq2ravbVDkCctgXOXkL2BJ.jpg","width":1280,"height":720,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/3bTeoQRUp1PfZNWm1D4bhQAMyV.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/tVtxfBkIYF5hHaRSGoEQd82eQ5k.jpg","width":1280,"height":720,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}],"logos":[{"file_path":"/fTCOUbtVNlAl4Q8etDPu7KZ3GwX.png","width":652,"height":463,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/lDWOMkMUyWcx8bCwmQ3ki2BQYnY.png","width":652,"height":463,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}]},"recommendations":[{"id":515042,"title":"Free Solo","original_title":"Free Solo","release_date":"2018-09-28","poster_path":"/v4QfYZMACODlWul9doN9RxE99ag.jpg","vote_average":7.9,"genre_ids":[99,12],"original_language":"en"},{"id":1599090,"title":"Gratte-ciel : L'ascension en direct","original_title":"Skyscraper Live","release_date":"2026-01-23","poster_path":"/lLdQaNQUrgkDyYIyEOd9lFhwozq.jpg","vote_average":7.5,"genre_ids":[12,99],"original_language":"en"},{"id":890825,"title":"14 x 8000 : Aux sommets de l'impossible","original_title":"14 Peaks: Nothing Is Impossible","release_date":"2021-11-12","poster_path":"/iJ4kJGqcmHYvvotC7OUlUfs7Abj.jpg","vote_average":7.323,"genre_ids":[99],"original_language":"en"},{"id":39333,"title":"180° South","original_title":"180° South","release_date":"2010-02-10","poster_path":"/jLvxcvpEbQ1bRETJZ3NlKpjQuLC.jpg","vote_average":7.263,"genre_ids":[99],"original_language":"en"},{"id":21736,"title":"Everest","original_title":"Everest","release_date":"1998-03-06","poster_path":"/a104Pkm7cHsztZK2wGiZFJmMqDs.jpg","vote_average":6.7,"genre_ids":[99],"original_language":"en"},{"id":1058647,"title":"Au plus profond","original_title":"The Deepest Breath","release_date":"2023-01-21","poster_path":"/kWhWhH4UmJrKBIgF9xdne0zdHAU.jpg","vote_average":7.598,"genre_ids":[99],"original_language":"en"},{"id":68450,"title":"The Art of Flight","original_title":"The Art of Flight","rele